    "note": "RITA groups beacon candidates by SNI/HTTP-host (beacon_type='sni'); Spectre's pcap-beacon rule groups by destination IP from conn.log. The ip_to_fqdn map below is the join key, derived from Zeek http.log Host headers on the same capture.",
