      "SF"
    ],
    "investigation": "The 8 RITA-flagged beacons pcap-beacon misses are not aperiodic. Zeek conn.log carries every TCP connection attempt, including half-open (SH), reset (RSTO) and other (OTH) connections that never completed a request. normalize_zeek_beacon does not filter on conn_state, so those attempts inject intervals into the series and drive rCV up. Restricting the series to established connections (SF/S1/RSTO) collapses the missed hosts onto the true ~206 s XLoader period. Recorded here as measurement; the shipped rule is unchanged."
  },
